for evidence of water-related processes on early Mars.

00:08:13.872 --> 00:08:20.972
James Webb observations of the Leviathan galaxy, according to Fizz.org, show stars spread across a

00:08:20.972 --> 00:08:26.972
large area rather than a concentrated core. In a view from when the universe was about 1.5 billion

00:08:26.972 --> 00:08:33.532
years old, an extended stellar distribution unlike typical compact dusty galaxies. A rat study

00:08:33.532 --> 00:08:38.952
reported by live science suggests prolonged exposure to galactic cosmic rays could produce

00:08:38.952 --> 00:08:46.852
heart tissue changes lasting years after return. A concern raised for Mars cruise. After 1142-1342

